{"id":"mf65xblcd94flz0qd41tcee5e","title":"弗朗西斯·克里克著作《惊人的假说》中的眼睛盲点“盲点”","originalTitle":"弗朗西斯·克里克（Francis Crick）的著作《惊人的假说》：关于眼睛盲点的一个“盲点”","summary":"弗朗西斯·克里克在其著作《惊人的假说》中讨论了眼睛盲点，但仅提及盲点的不可见性，未提及在特殊视觉条件下盲点的可见性。这种可见性现象被称为La Hire-Purkinje视觉现象，它与视觉意识密切相关，但在相关教科书中鲜有提及。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=322380&do=blog&id=1561590"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T02:26:42.933Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T02:26:42.933Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果"],"score":29,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}